# Dynamic Test Tool

列车简易动态调试辅助工具

Simple Dynamic Testing Auxiliary Tool for Trains


----------------------------------------

![image](https://github.com/cnybh/pats_tools/blob/main/logodynamictool.jpg?raw=true)

------


使用安卓手机内置的陀螺仪和GPS信号，简易分析车辆的振动和家减速度计算的辅助工具。

This is a simple tool that uses the built-in gyroscope and GPS signals of an Android phone to analyze vehicle vibration and calculate deceleration.

